; The one variable: `autowrap_mode`, plus `autowrap_trim_flags` on NoTrim. Button::_shape ORs the trim
; flags onto the mode's break flags (button.cpp:546-561) and shapes at the rect less the stylebox
; margins (:428-432). Off is the control. NoTrim keeps the edge space the default trim removes.
; No other Button fixture authors either key, and a Label wraps through a different _shape.

